      "message": "test(ui): the colour guard counts only constructors of written numbers\n\nA constructor over variables, such as from_rgb(r, g, b), converts a\ncolour chosen elsewhere. The guard counted it as a literal, so a family\nPR would have had to move code that a theme cannot reach. Now a\nconstructor counts only when each argument is a number written in\nplace, also across lines. Named constants still count. The list is now\n24 files and 142 literals.\n\nRefs #1120\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
